! Title: BBC iPlayer Filters by Nikoboi
! Description: Removes all the trash from the iPlayer home page, leaving only "Continue watching..."
! Author: Nikoboi
!
! Homepage: https://block.nikoboi.dev/
! Repository: https://github.com/NikoboiNFTB/Blocklists
